Package: sihlib
Title: Load, Filter and Reconstruct SIH/SUS Hospital Admissions
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("lucasolt", email = "lucasolt@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Helpers to analyse SIH/SUS (Brazilian public hospital information
    system) reduced AIH files: a cached loader on top of 'microdatasus' (local
    folder, Google Drive, then DATASUS), filters by ICD-10 code, specialty and
    admission date, reconstruction of hospital stays from AIH lines, counts by
    municipality and indirectly standardised rates with exact Poisson intervals.
